{"id":"8b69e359479982ba","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-thm-atiyah-singer.md","title":"Atiyah–Singer Index Theorem","display":"thm-atiyah-singer — Atiyah–Singer Index Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-atiyah-singer","aliases":["58-thm-atiyah-singer"],"display":"thm-atiyah-singer — Atiyah–Singer Index Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-elliptic-operator]]","[[58-df-compact-manifold]]","[[58-df-complex-vector-bundle]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-atiyah-singer"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-atiyah-singer</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-atiyah-singer — Atiyah–Singer Index Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0d5fef79e71e464f\" href=\"?note=0d5fef79e71e464f\" title=\"58-df-elliptic-operator\">58-df-elliptic-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"871fa7428f3b8459\" href=\"?note=871fa7428f3b8459\" title=\"58-df-compact-manifold\">58-df-compact-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"97bfaddac2f220a7\" href=\"?note=97bfaddac2f220a7\" title=\"58-df-complex-vector-bundle\">58-df-complex-vector-bundle</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EllipticDifferentialOperator}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{EllipticDifferentialOperator}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is a compact smooth manifold without boundary and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E^+,E^-\">\\(E^+,E^-\\)</span> are complex vector bundles on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:\\Gamma^\\infty(E^+)\\to\\Gamma^\\infty(E^-)\">\\(P:\\Gamma^\\infty(E^+)\\to\\Gamma^\\infty(E^-)\\)</span> is an elliptic differential operator</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ind}_{\\mathrm a}(P)=\\dim_{\\mathbb C}\\ker P-\\dim_{\\mathbb C}\\operatorname{coker}P\">\\(\\operatorname{ind}_{\\mathrm a}(P)=\\dim_{\\mathbb C}\\ker P-\\dim_{\\mathbb C}\\operatorname{coker}P\\)</span> is its analytic Fredholm index</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\sigma(P)]\\in K_c^0(T^*M)\">\\([\\sigma(P)]\\in K_c^0(T^*M)\\)</span> is the compactly supported <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>-theory class of its invertible principal symbol off the zero section</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}_c([\\sigma(P)])\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}_c([\\sigma(P)])\\)</span> is its compactly supported Chern character and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Td}(T_M\\otimes\\mathbb C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Td}(T_M\\otimes\\mathbb C)\\)</span> is the Todd class</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EllipticDifferentialOperator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EllipticDifferentialOperator}_S\\)</span> are the typed predicates for these data</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}atiyah\\text{-}singer} \\vdash \\forall\\tau_M,n\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,n)\\land\\partial M=\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{EllipticDifferentialOperator}_S(P,E^+,E^-,M)\\to\\operatorname{ind}_{\\mathrm a}(P)=\\int_{T^*M}\\operatorname{ch}_c([\\sigma(P)])\\smile\\pi^*\\operatorname{Td}(T_M\\otimes\\mathbb C)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}atiyah\\text{-}singer} \\vdash \\forall\\tau_M,n\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,n)\\land\\partial M=\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{EllipticDifferentialOperator}_S(P,E^+,E^-,M)\\to\\operatorname{ind}_{\\mathrm a}(P)=\\int_{T^*M}\\operatorname{ch}_c([\\sigma(P)])\\smile\\pi^*\\operatorname{Td}(T_M\\otimes\\mathbb C)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The compact-manifold premise now supplies the topology and dimension required by its registered three-place signature. The removed <code>df-index</code> dependency defines subgroup index and is unrelated to the Fredholm index.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ind}_{\\mathrm a}(P) = \\dim \\ker P - \\dim \\mathrm{coker} P\">\\(\\operatorname{ind}_{\\mathrm a}(P) = \\dim \\ker P - \\dim \\mathrm{coker} P\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The topological index uses characteristic classes.</li>\n<li>Analytic index defined via <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2\">\\(L^2\\)</span> spaces.</li>\n<li>Generalizes Gauss–Bonnet–Chern and Riemann–Roch.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-elliptic-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0d5fef79e71e464f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elliptic-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-compact-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"871fa7428f3b8459","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-compact-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-complex-vector-bundle","status":"resolved","id":"97bfaddac2f220a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-complex-vector-bundle]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EllipticDifferentialOperator}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"E^+,E^-","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"P:\\Gamma^\\infty(E^+)\\to\\Gamma^\\infty(E^-)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ind}_{\\mathrm a}(P)=\\dim_{\\mathbb C}\\ker P-\\dim_{\\mathbb C}\\operatorname{coker}P","display":false},{"tex":"[\\sigma(P)]\\in K_c^0(T^*M)","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ch}_c([\\sigma(P)])","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Td}(T_M\\otimes\\mathbb C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EllipticDifferentialOperator}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}atiyah\\text{-}singer} \\vdash \\forall\\tau_M,n\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,n)\\land\\partial M=\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{EllipticDifferentialOperator}_S(P,E^+,E^-,M)\\to\\operatorname{ind}_{\\mathrm a}(P)=\\int_{T^*M}\\operatorname{ch}_c([\\sigma(P)])\\smile\\pi^*\\operatorname{Td}(T_M\\otimes\\mathbb C)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ind}_{\\mathrm a}(P) = \\dim \\ker P - \\dim \\mathrm{coker} P","display":false},{"tex":"L^2","display":false}],"bytes":2063,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4033","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-thm-atiyah-singer.md|58-thm-atiyah-singer]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["0d5fef79e71e464f","871fa7428f3b8459","97bfaddac2f220a7"]}